      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="oath" id="oath">
      <div class="eyebrow">III / The realm’s commitment</div>

      <blockquote>
        “We stand for a realm of one people:
        united in purpose, protected by strength,
        enriched by knowledge and sustained by care. an land in which elegance of ostars, etiquette of mums and finesse of the dead is recognised”
      </blockquote>

      <p>Midgudr Realm Advocacy</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Midgudr’s original fan charter
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
